  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "800001",
      "subQuestName": "Go near the Adventurers' Guild Bulletin Board",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80000101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80000101": {
            "id": "80000101",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Yes, yes. They have the audacity to go after anything.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000102"
            ]
          },
          "80000102": {
            "id": "80000102",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "The Seven, dragons, gods... no ancient artifact that relates can escape their greedy ambitions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000103"
            ]
          },
          "80000103": {
            "id": "80000103",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Still, this time is different... Who do they think they are, going after the Abyss Order's treasures...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000104"
            ]
          },
          "80000104": {
            "id": "80000104",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Oh, Traveler, it's you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000105"
            ]
          },
          "80000105": {
            "id": "80000105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Ganyu, what are you doing here with Lan? Do you have a commission you need to post?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000106"
            ]
          },
          "80000106": {
            "id": "80000106",
            "speakerId": 1015,
            "speakerName": "Ganyu",
            "text": "#Hello, {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000107"
            ]
          },
          "80000107": {
            "id": "80000107",
            "speakerId": 1015,
            "speakerName": "Ganyu",
            "text": "We were just discussing the Treasure Hoarders.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000108"
            ]
          },
          "80000108": {
            "id": "80000108",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Yes, we were just saying how even the audacious Treasure Hoarders should know better than to mess with the Abyss — it's just too evil.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000109"
            ]
          },
          "80000109": {
            "id": "80000109",
            "speakerId": 1015,
            "speakerName": "Ganyu",
            "text": "But we recently received intel from the Ministry of Civil Affairs that two big-time Treasure Hoarders in Liyue and Mondstadt are planning some big joint operation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000110"
            ]
          },
          "80000110": {
            "id": "80000110",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Two big-time Treasure Hoarders\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000111"
            ]
          },
          "80000111": {
            "id": "80000111",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Yes, they're known as \"Big Sis of the South\" and \"Raptor of the North.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000112"
            ]
          },
          "80000112": {
            "id": "80000112",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ahh! Raptor! Paimon remembers he tried to run away from Amber in Mondstadt... But who is \"Big Sis of the South\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000116",
              "80000115"
            ]
          },
          "80000116": {
            "id": "80000116",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "You are correct. She is the head of the Treasure Hoarders in Liyue. As I understand it, the Treasure Hoarders all call her \"Boss.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000117"
            ]
          },
          "80000117": {
            "id": "80000117",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Some say that the God of Thieves even bestowed a gift upon her for her exploits, making her \"Big Sis of the Gods.\" ...But that's probably just a wild rumor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000118"
            ]
          },
          "80000118": {
            "id": "80000118",
            "speakerId": 1015,
            "speakerName": "Ganyu",
            "text": "Anyway, the Treasure Hoarders discovered some previously unexplored ruins that the Abyss Order has been secretly guarding in the shadows.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000119"
            ]
          },
          "80000119": {
            "id": "80000119",
            "speakerId": 1015,
            "speakerName": "Ganyu",
            "text": "Despite how dangerous that makes it, all the Treasure Hoarders can think about is what kinds of treasure could be inside...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000120"
            ]
          },
          "80000120": {
            "id": "80000120",
            "speakerId": 1015,
            "speakerName": "Ganyu",
            "text": "They have already devised a plan: they will send out a decoy to divert the Abyss Order's forces away from the ruins, then send an expert thief inside to steal the treasure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000121"
            ]
          },
          "80000121": {
            "id": "80000121",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "To this end, Big Sis and Raptor have reportedly recruited a certain \"Grand Thief\" from Fontaine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000122"
            ]
          },
          "80000122": {
            "id": "80000122",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Grand Thief\"? That's quite an impressive-sounding title.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000123"
            ]
          },
          "80000123": {
            "id": "80000123",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "Indeed. He is an extraordinary individual.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000124"
            ]
          },
          "80000124": {
            "id": "80000124",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "The Grand Thief is highly respected in the Treasure Hoarders, in the same way that we adventurers look up to great adventurers."
          },
          "80000115": {
            "id": "80000115",
            "speakerId": 2016,
            "speakerName": "Lan",
            "text": "You already know something then. I guess you must have crossed paths with the Treasure Hoarders many times before."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800002",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the ruins",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80000201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80000201": {
            "id": "80000201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Th—This looks like a person!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000202"
            ]
          },
          "80000202": {
            "id": "80000202",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Could it be the Grand Thief?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000203"
            ]
          },
          "80000203": {
            "id": "80000203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Why is he in that position? Is he praying to something?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000204"
            ]
          },
          "80000204": {
            "id": "80000204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000205"
            ]
          },
          "80000205": {
            "id": "80000205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000208"
            ]
          },
          "80000208": {
            "id": "80000208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wh—Why is this Statue of The Seven... hanging upside-down...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000209"
            ]
          },
          "80000209": {
            "id": "80000209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And the statue's hands... Paimon remembers they are normally holding an orb, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000210"
            ]
          },
          "80000210": {
            "id": "80000210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But, this statue is holding... What is that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000211"
            ]
          },
          "80000211": {
            "id": "80000211",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uhh... Paimon has a really bad feeling about this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000212"
            ]
          },
          "80000212": {
            "id": "80000212",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And the Grand Thief hasn't moved an inch. D—Do you think he's...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000213"
            ]
          },
          "80000213": {
            "id": "80000213",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Um... hello...? Are you okay mister?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000214"
            ]
          },
          "80000214": {
            "id": "80000214",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Observe the \"Grand Thief\"",
            "text": "(There's no reaction, nor any sign of breathing.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000215"
            ]
          },
          "80000215": {
            "id": "80000215",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...H—He's dead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000216"
            ]
          },
          "80000216": {
            "id": "80000216",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Paimon doesn't feel so good, {NICKNAME}."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800003",
      "subQuestName": "Follow the Treasure Hoarders",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80000301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80000301": {
            "id": "80000301",
            "speakerId": 10916,
            "speakerName": "Abyss Herald",
            "text": "This power... It seems familiar...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000302"
            ]
          },
          "80000302": {
            "id": "80000302",
            "speakerId": 10916,
            "speakerName": "Abyss Herald",
            "text": "Hmph...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000303"
            ]
          },
          "80000303": {
            "id": "80000303",
            "speakerId": 10916,
            "speakerName": "Abyss Herald",
            "text": "I see... So, it's you... you are the one!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000304"
            ]
          },
          "80000304": {
            "id": "80000304",
            "speakerId": 10916,
            "speakerName": "Abyss Herald",
            "text": "In that case, I shall stay here no longer...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000305"
            ]
          },
          "80000305": {
            "id": "80000305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Whew... What a tough battle. Are you okay, {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000306"
            ]
          },
          "80000306": {
            "id": "80000306",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Such a strong enemy. Who knew the Abyss Order had monsters this powerful among them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000307"
            ]
          },
          "80000307": {
            "id": "80000307",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(It seemed to... know me.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000308"
            ]
          },
          "80000308": {
            "id": "80000308",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? What is it? What are you thinking about?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000309"
            ]
          },
          "80000309": {
            "id": "80000309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Nothing, let's just get out of here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80000310"
            ]
          },
          "80000310": {
            "id": "80000310",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, right, yeah... We're near the exit now. Let's get outta this scary place before something even more dangerous shows up!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
